WEBVTT

1
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:11,700
The original price is 8 million, and our store’s 15% discount is combined with a 10% discount for silver members.

2
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:17,020
The actual deduction was 6.84 million, I thought you packaged it well

3
00:00:17,020 --> 00:00:20,660
Okay, very good, this order directly saves 760,000 yuan

4
00:00:20,660 --> 00:00:25,660
Including the guaranteed endorsement fees, the hidden income has exceeded 15.76 million.

5
00:00:25,660 --> 00:00:26,690
I also want to ask a question

6
00:00:26,690 --> 00:00:34,060
If I have learned to reduce the low level, then I can learn to reduce the ultimate

7
00:00:34,060 --> 00:00:38,280
Will skills be overridden? Or will they be two separate skills?

8
00:00:38,280 --> 00:00:43,410
Sorry, as far as I know, no one has ever repeatedly purchased mid-to-high-level consent skills.

9
00:00:43,410 --> 00:00:46,980
I can't give you an answer to this question

10
00:00:46,980 --> 00:00:48,980
Just wait a moment, I'll make a call

11
00:00:48,980 --> 00:00:54,220
Lin Mo, what's the matter?

12
00:00:54,220 --> 00:00:56,220
That's right, Teacher Xu, I have a question

13
00:00:56,220 --> 00:00:59,220
If you have already learned to reduce the low level, then learn to reduce the ultimate

14
00:00:59,220 --> 00:01:02,220
Is it a direct coverage, or will it become two independent skills?
